{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_009_02_e",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:f435f79d45fb121d4f2b3c59b7f3b6a63d411b729de489ed768ad74b2ff7cbe1",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_02_1_2_009_02:1_2_009_02_e:cmd-000020:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1d49b196ea13d8d7d5243f3e88926df0f0ea0bbbab708b2ccfb7c173f42e4aa3",
      "text": "生日派对当天……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_02_1_2_009_02:1_2_009_02_e:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5c1ed44262f97eb6e009fe9b6eb985d951203eabc39563e9ad935c6bd7980855",
      "text": "预备——",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_02_1_2_009_02:1_2_009_02_e:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1b38131093737bbdcc63120d98729d7c79f2e34f961dae277514178d49a58358",
      "text": "恭二，祝你生日快乐！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_02_1_2_009_02:1_2_009_02_e:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b22722680d4402b2216f595b9c167a7ea12b761f59d16967441b23f951709e87",
      "text": "祝你生日快乐，恭二。\n呵呵，惊讶的表情很不错嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_02_1_2_009_02:1_2_009_02_e:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:83057d21c0cf84aeabe516f5f3a23ecbf9c04eb9ce6cbb2670f7e6f8ea99a49b",
      "text": "不是，因为……这完全超出了想象啊。\n布置也好……这个花束也是，真的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_02_1_2_009_02:1_2_009_02_e:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c30d55c7bbaf4fa77e24490b6659c3bd71efb0c46a669d12c7152ce99cb852eb",
      "text": "而且菜品和蛋糕也都这么豪华。\n……我超级开心的。谢谢你们。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_02_1_2_009_02:1_2_009_02_e:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1fa14e8b37cc2315a599ec07c248a656e8c6e4afc8fc7678694eb7c66aac07ee",
      "text": "蛋糕是制作人准备的。\n这些菜是商店街肉铺的，这边是鱼铺的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_02_1_2_009_02:1_2_009_02_e:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:13a5a473924f0f81107246ebdc369fa349c6dbdacc0ba96a151307d08d548464",
      "text": "说是要办派对，大家都多送了好多菜。\n商店街的大家，最喜欢恭二了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_02_1_2_009_02:1_2_009_02_e:cmd-000098:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c423473bc2b2dda0befded8cb6316ed2ed04b4de290e9945db6acd7331c76dea",
      "text": "这样啊……也得跟商店街的大家道谢才行呢。\n还有帮忙准备的制作人也是。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_02_1_2_009_02:1_2_009_02_e:cmd-000107:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:340a20ea42d177d3492b443bfca6d2038ba398fa6ac091aca196c862153c277f",
      "text": "来！今天就尽情享受吧！\n礼物也准备好了，敬请期待哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_02_1_2_009_02:1_2_009_02_e:cmd-000113:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:70bc709713b29a96ff615b46ab015b19a85f5e34cba1a6d1088212cf4e892c78",
      "text": "好的。非常感谢。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
